{"loading_messages":["Placing envoys on the timeline","Sorting scrolls from silver"],"title":"europe_asia_contact_works_by_date_medium","widget_code":"<h2 class=\"sr-only\">Scatter plot of 29 Rijksmuseum works about European–Asian contact, by date and medium, marking which a place search finds.</h2>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);\">\n<span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"6\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#2a78d6\"/></svg>Found by depicted place (23)</span>\n<span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon points=\"6,1 11,11 1,11\" fill=\"#eda100\"/></svg>Production place only (1)</span>\n<span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon points=\"6,0 12,6 6,12 0,6\" fill=\"#eb6834\"/></svg>Catalogue text only (5)</span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;height:360px;\">\n<canvas id=\"c1\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Scatter of works by year (1600 to 2000) and medium. Most works are dated 1640 to 1870 and are found by a depicted place. Five works reachable only through catalogue text: a painted harpsichord lid of 1605, a print of 1675, a Japanese print of 1861, a silver cup of 1918 and a photograph of about 1990.\">Works by date and medium, marked by whether a place search finds them.</canvas>\n</div>\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/Chart.js/4.4.1/chart.umd.js\"></script>\n<script>\nconst rows=['Photograph','Decorative arts','Drawing','Print / book illustration','Painting, scroll, screen'];\nconst W=[\n['SK-A-4947','Amsterdam as the Centre of World Trade',1605,4,'t'],\n['RP-P-OB-75.432','The prince of Aceh receives the Dutch',1645,3,'d'],\n['SK-A-2350','VOC senior merchant with wife and enslaved servant',1652,4,'d'],\n['SK-A-3879','The Dutch ambassador on his way to Isfahan',1656,4,'d'],\n['SK-A-4062','Cnoll family with two enslaved servants',1665,4,'d'],\n['RP-P-1916-427','Dutch ambassador received outside Peking',1670,3,'d'],\n['RP-P-OB-47.384','Dutch ambassador received outside Peking',1671,3,'d'],\n['RP-P-1878-A-484','Europeans killed by Chinese',1675,3,'t'],\n['RP-P-OB-47.387','Dutch diplomats at the imperial court of China',1693,3,'d'],\n['NG-1987-7','Ketelaar embassy at Udaipur',1711,4,'d'],\n['NG-1994-12','Three Dutchmen in a sloop (Canton ivory)',1737,1,'d'],\n['AK-RBK-1959-35','Cup with Europeans in a Chinese shop',1740,1,'p'],\n['NG-1060','Batavia 1740, map of the massacre',1740,3,'d'],\n['RP-P-1944-1898','Massacre of the Chinese in Batavia',1762,3,'d'],\n['BK-1976-49','Chitqua, Dutch merchant (clay)',1770,1,'d'],\n['NG-1981-12-A','Weighing VOC tea chests, Canton',1770,2,'d'],\n['NG-1981-12-B','Sampling the tea, Canton',1770,2,'d'],\n['RP-T-1904-18','Kandyan envoys received in Colombo',1772,2,'d'],\n['RP-P-1907-2281','Hambroek on Formosa',1776,3,'d'],\n['NG-377','VOC delegation before the king of Kandy',1786,2,'d'],\n['NG-1978-110','Dutchmen at a meal (Nagasaki print)',1800,3,'d'],\n['NG-456','Ishizaki Yushi, Dutchmen and foreigners',1825,4,'d'],\n['NG-1977-4','The trading post at Dejima',1840,4,'d'],\n['NG-2009-134','Model of a Javanese marketplace',1845,1,'d'],\n['NG-663-3','Dutch family in Yokohama',1861,3,'d'],\n['RP-P-1962-341','Five nationalities at a banquet',1861,3,'t'],\n['SK-A-2725','Medusa forcing the Shimonoseki Strait',1864,4,'d'],\n['AK-RAK-2022-6','Zhang Xun cup for the Dutch legation',1918,1,'t'],\n['NG-2011-18-31-9','Van der Louw and Deng Xiaoping',1990,0,'t']];\nconst seen={};\nconst pts=W.map(w=>{const k=w[3]+'_'+Math.round(w[2]/12);const n=seen[k]=(seen[k]||0)+1;const off=[0,0.22,-0.22,0.11,-0.11][(n-1)%5];return {x:w[2],y:w[3]+off,id:w[0],t:w[1],k:w[4]};});\nconst ds=(k,lab,col,sh,r)=>({label:lab,data:pts.filter(p=>p.k===k),backgroundColor:col,borderColor:'#ffffff',borderWidth:1.5,pointStyle:sh,pointRadius:r,pointHoverRadius:r+2});\nconst dark=matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches;\nconst muted='#898781',grid=dark?'#2c2c2a':'#e1e0d9';\nnew Chart(document.getElementById('c1'),{type:'scatter',\ndata:{datasets:[ds('d','Depicted place','#2a78d6','circle',6),ds('p','Production place only','#eda100','triangle',8),ds('t','Catalogue text only','#eb6834','rectRot',9)]},\noptions:{responsive:true,maintainAspectRatio:false,layout:{padding:{top:8,right:12}},\nplugins:{legend:{display:false},tooltip:{callbacks:{label:c=>c.raw.t+' ('+c.raw.id+', '+c.raw.x+')'}}},\nscales:{x:{min:1590,max:2000,ticks:{stepSize:50,color:muted,callback:v=>String(v)},grid:{display:false},border:{color:grid}},\ny:{min:-0.6,max:4.6,ticks:{stepSize:1,color:muted,callback:v=>rows[v]??''},grid:{color:grid},border:{display:false}}}}});\n</script>"}